  "description": "MrCogito E37 e37b (concept memory + looped reasoner) at 30M (scripts/run_e33n.py --arm e37b --size s30; spec docs/experiments_specs/ahead/E37_concept_memory.md). Same trunk as E33n s30 (scripts/run_e33n.py --size s30, FFN 1472): width 576, GPT-2 vocabulary with a 256-wide factorised input, 2 local pre layers (window 128), the reading layer (no RoPE), 5 local stack layers, 9 query heads x 64 with one key/value head; the reading layer and the next layer loop 4 rounds. Protocol: E33p stage 1 (1.5B FineWeb-Edu tokens at 4k, then 0.2B LongDocs-lite at 16k, 64 rows per step). Concept memory on the reading layer: each closed 512-key block is grouped by content into 64 balanced concepts of 8 keys (Sinkhorn soft k-means, no gradient, no weights), each with links to its member tokens and summed statistics (count, mean key, key variance, mean value, mean state). Each query reads one softmax over sinks, its block window, the opened member tokens and one summary per other concept (logit log n + q.mu_k/sqrt(d) + |q|^2 sigma^2/(2d), value mu_v). Trainable parameters match the trainer: 75,323,092 (the dense trunk + a 6,621,696-parameter looped reasoner: 2 layers of width 512, 8 heads, run 2 loops). Approximations in the builder: the block window and opened tokens are counted as a 1,280-key window; the concepts are drawn from the input of the reading layer's first round.",
